#   or asking for the catalog is product; R3 asking for contact (WhatsApp, número, DM) is
#   store; R4 complaints, reviews and the business's own text are general; R5 praise of a
#   product is general.
# Split: 'dev' tunes the prompt, 'test' is held out and only scored (stratified by rarest
# label, seed 24789644). Never tune on 'test'.
